---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How MyVisaDTV collects, uses and protects your personal data."
  lang="en"
  translated
>
  <section class="section max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl text-indigo">Privacy policy</h1>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-encre/85">
      <p class="rounded-sm border border-or-dark/40 bg-jade-bg px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-encre/70">
        This is an informational translation. The French version of this page is the
        legally binding one under GDPR, notably regarding the legal basis for processing,
        the exact retention period, and data protection officer contact details where
        applicable.
      </p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-indigo">Data collected</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Through the intake form and your exchanges with your advisor, we may collect:
          your identity, contact details, professional situation, and information relating
          to your move to Thailand, as well as the supporting documents needed to build
          your file.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-indigo">Purpose</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This data is used exclusively to assess your eligibility, prepare and follow up
          on your visa application, and contact you in this context.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-indigo">Retention</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          [Retention period to be defined] from the end of the support process or the last
          contact, unless a longer legal retention requirement applies.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-indigo">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Under GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, erase, and port your data. To
          exercise these rights, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:contact@myvisadtv.com" class="underline hover:text-indigo">contact@myvisadtv.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
